# A32SP2FM.DLL (CD, 24576 bytes, CRC-32 156135e3): AIL/32's XMIDI driver
# for the Sound Blaster Pro 2's and 16's OPL3, xmidi32.asm with the
# yamaha32.inc it includes for SBPRO2, one object at 0x10000 (0x43b5
# bytes, CRC-32 3da7ff01 with its fixups applied there). Regions (X
# code, R read-only data, W variables) cut the object exactly. Then come
# the functions (T), data (D, sized) and unreachable blocks (U). The
# data's places are those of JWasm's listing of the source, which lays
# them out as the CD's driver.
0x10000 R index 0x163
0x10163 W ddt 0x56
0x101b9 R tables 0x532
0x106eb W synthdata 0xed4
0x115bf X synth 0x16bc
0x12c7b W seqdata 0x22b
0x12ea6 X seq 0x150f
